/**
 * @page architecture Architecture
 * @brief How the modules are layered and how they depend on each other.
 *
 * @section arch_layers Layers
 *
 * The code is split into layers, each one a group in this reference:
 *
 * - @ref hal - the only layer that talks to hardware.
 * - @ref util - pure helpers with no hardware dependency.
 * - @ref led - a driver that uses @ref hal_gpio.
 *
 * @section arch_deps Dependencies
 *
 * - @ref led depends on @ref hal_gpio.
 * - @ref util_calc depends on @ref util_mul.
 * - Nothing in @ref util depends on @ref hal.
 *
 * @section arch_testing Testing
 *
 * The hardware abstraction layer is replaced by generated mocks in unit
 * tests, so modules built on top of it, such as @ref led, run on the host
 * without hardware.
 */
